    "evidence_text": "David Castro (actor)\n\nAustin Williams\n\nChristoph Waltz\n\n Waltz is widely known for his works with American filmmaker Quentin Tarantino, he received acclaim for portraying SS-Standartenf\u00fchrer Hans Landa in \"Inglourious Basterds\" (2009) and bounty hunter Dr. King Schultz in \"Django Unchained\" (2012).\n\n Waltz also received the Best Actor Award at the Cannes Film Festival and a Screen Actors Guild Award for his portrayal of Landa.\n\nDaniel Henney\n\nDaniel Phillip Henney or Jeom Deok-su (born November 28, 1979) is an American actor and model, known for starring in films such as \"Seducing Mr. Perfect\" (2006), \"My Father\" (2007), \"\" (2009), \"Shanghai Calling\" (2012), \"The Last Stand\" (2013), and \"Big Hero 6\" (2014).\n\nSpring Waltz\n\nSpring Waltz () is a 2006 South Korean television series starring Seo Do-young, Han Hyo-joo, Daniel Henney, and Lee So-yeon.",
